# The shared lines, Phase 8 session 3 (Docs/Design/84 §33, §14.1's thin topics): gossip (talk.gossip), 70 openers
# before this phase. The topic's openers are the point (§33.1), so these carry the concept; none hands on, so the
# answer is whatever answers tell.gossip best (session 1's react.news by claim kind and its variants, ask.detail, a
# view), never one written for a different kind of claim.
#
# The facts (Core/RatwAmbient.cpp World::ambientTopic; claims.json): topic.subject (the one talked of, by name, or as
# the teller saw them, "that grey stranger"), topic.claim (the claim's words after the name: "stole from Hild
# Ashdown", "is wanted by the Watch for theft", "married Wren Ashdown", "died", "was robbed by someone nobody could make
# out", "breaks promises", "was prowling about", "is new in town"), topic.claim_kind (its kind), topic.victim (the
# second party, where the claim has one), and their sexes for #topic.they# and #topic.victim_them#.
#
# The rules they keep (§7.8, §8.6, §11): what the claim says and no more (no "took the lot", no "in broad daylight");
# the teller had it from someone (#hearsay#, "they say", "I'm told"), never "I saw" (the eyewitness lines are the
# library's own, gated to topic.seen); pity and gladness by the claim's kind; the one talked of by name and pronoun
# symbol, never "they" for one known wolf; nothing of where the subject lives or works (they may be a traveller).
# Who says it by the grammar (#s8_psst#: the sly, the chatty, the nervy, the devout, a pup); what about by criteria:
# the claim's kind, the place, the teller's trade and lot.

## ================================================================ Theft (stole from, tried to steal from)

rule s83g_theft_1
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #s8_psst# #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Lock your door. | Watch your purse. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, I'm told.

rule s83g_theft_2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll say this once. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Light paws, that one. | They're saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Count your spoons.

rule s83g_theft_3
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say You know #topic.subject#? #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#, apparently. | Mark this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #hearsay#, but #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_4
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Of all things. | Talk is #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'd keep my door barred. | #s8_psst# #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_5
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Can you credit it? | I can't stop thinking about it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Did you know #topic.subject# #topic.claim#? I didn't.

rule s83g_theft_6
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Keep a paw on your things. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. #robbery#. | A #thief# among us. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_7
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Or so the story goes. | The way I heard it, #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject#, if you please. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_8
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say There's a #thief# about. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | I'm told #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Bold as brass. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Nobody's safe, these days.

rule s83g_theft_9
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I feel for #topic.victim_them#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Of all wolves to rob. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. #topic.victim_they.capitalize# didn't deserve that.

rule s83g_theft_10
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Is it true? #topic.subject# #topic.claim#? That's the talk. | I don't know what to make of it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'd never have thought it.

rule s83g_theft_11
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Word to the wise: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. If you see #topic.them#, keep your bag close. | Thieving now, is it? #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_12
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. #grumble#. Everyone's at it. | It's going round that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | You'll not believe it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_tavern
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=tavern
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Mind your coat on the peg. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Over a cup, I heard #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Keep your purse in your lap tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_tavern2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=tavern
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say The whole bench is talking. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Don't leave your cup unwatched. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | Ale and rumour. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_work
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=work
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Keep your tools in sight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Quietly. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Not a word while we're at it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_work2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=work
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Lock up well tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Everyone at the bench has heard. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Between jobs, I heard #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_market
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=market
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Watch the stalls. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Every stall's heard by now. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Purse in front, where you can see it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_street
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.place=street|gate
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Out here, anyone could hear. But #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Walk with me. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Shutters will be barred tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_night
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft here.time=night
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Bar the door tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Dark nights and light paws. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Not a night to leave the shutters open. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_merchant
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.role=merchant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'm keeping the good stock under the counter. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Shopkeepers talk. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'll want coin up front from #topic.them#.

rule s83g_theft_merchant2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.role=merchant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say If #topic.subject# comes to my counter, I'll be watching #topic.their# paws. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Bad for trade, a #thief#. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | The stalls are passing it along. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_guard
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Off the record. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | You didn't hear it from the Watch. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | I'd want a witness. But #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, the talk goes.

rule s83g_theft_keeper
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=innkeeper|brewer
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I hear everything over the bar. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | If #topic.subject# comes in, I'll count the cups. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | Barrel-talk. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_servant
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=servant|cook
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Below stairs, it's all anyone says. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Kitchen talk. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Don't let my master hear I said it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_smith
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=smith|crafter
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll put a better lock on my shop. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Good iron's worth stealing. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, I hear. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I've a lock that'd stop #topic.them#.

rule s83g_theft_rich
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.wealth=rich
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say One hears #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Shocking. | Dreadful business. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, apparently. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. One locks the silver now.

rule s83g_theft_poor
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. As if any of us has anything worth taking. | Not that there's much at mine to steal. But #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | They'll blame the likes of us. But #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_beggar
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=beggar|laborer
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Down our way, they're saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | You hear things, on the steps. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. And the Watch will look at us first.

rule s83g_theft_priest
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=priest
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'd rather not repeat it, but you should know. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | The Bright One sees what's taken. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | Pray for both of them. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_carter
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.job=carter|sailor|fisher
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll be sleeping on my load tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Road talk, this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'll rope my cargo down twice.

rule s83g_theft_old
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.stage=old
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say In my day you could leave a door open. Now #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I've seen it all, and now this. | The town's not what it was. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_theft_young
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=theft self.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #s8_psst# #topic.subject# #topic.claim#! | Everyone's saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Is that true? | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That's really bad, isn't it?

## ================================================================ Wanted by the Watch

rule s83g_wanted_1
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #s8_psst# #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Keep clear. | The Watch is after #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Did you know? | There's a warrant. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | You'll want to know this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_3
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say If you see #topic.subject#, say nothing and walk away. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'd not stand too near #topic.them#. | #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. #uneasy#.

rule s83g_wanted_4
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | The word is #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #hearsay#. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_5
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say So the Watch wants #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That's not a name you want on a warrant. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Rather #topic.them# than me.

rule s83g_wanted_6
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I always wondered. | Fancy that. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'd not want to be in #topic.their# boots.

rule s83g_wanted_7
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say You'll hear it soon enough. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | The Watch has a name up. #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. The whole town knows it now.

rule s83g_wanted_8
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Don't go helping #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Best not be seen with #topic.them#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That'll be the end of #topic.their# good name.

rule s83g_wanted_tavern
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted here.place=tavern
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say If #topic.subject# walks in, I'm walking out. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | Quiet. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | The barkeep won't serve #topic.subject# now. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_work
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted here.place=work|market
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Don't sell to #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | Heads down. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Everyone's been told. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_street
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted here.place=street|gate
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Eyes open on the road. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | They'll be watching the gate. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Keep to the lit streets.

rule s83g_wanted_guard
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say If you see #topic.subject#, come and find me. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | Between us, #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. We'll find #topic.them#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Tell no one I told you, but tell me if you see #topic.them#.

rule s83g_wanted_merchant
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.role=merchant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll not take #topic.subject#'s coin now. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | No credit for #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | The stalls are talking. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_keeper
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.job=innkeeper|cook|servant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say No room for #topic.subject# under my roof. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | I've been told to look out for #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | Kitchens hear everything. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_carter
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.job=carter|sailor|fisher|herder
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'll not give #topic.them# a ride. | On the road they're saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Nobody's taking #topic.subject# anywhere. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_wanted_rich
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.wealth=rich
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say One hears #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. How dreadful. | Everyone up the hill is talking of it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. One feels quite unsafe.

rule s83g_wanted_poor
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. The Watch will be on our streets now, poking. | They're after #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. We'll all get looked at. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Somebody'll get dragged in for it, guilty or not.

rule s83g_wanted_old
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=wanted self.stage=old
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I've outlived better and worse. | A warrant, at #topic.their# age. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Well. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I've seen it come to that before.

## ================================================================ Violence (attacked, is violent)

rule s83g_violence_1
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #s8_psst# #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. #uneasy#. | They're saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'm shaking just saying it.

rule s83g_violence_2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Keep your distance. | Have you heard? #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, I'm told. #pity#.

rule s83g_violence_3
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say It's not safe, is it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. Gods. | #hearsay#, but #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_violence_4
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'd not walk alone tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. You'd never think it to look at #topic.them#. | Stay clear of #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_violence_5
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I hope #topic.victim_they#'s mending. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Rotten luck for #topic.victim_them#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Somebody should sit with #topic.victim_them#.

rule s83g_violence_6
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That's not gossip, that's a warning. | I'm telling everyone. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Somebody should do something.

rule s83g_violence_tavern
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence here.place=tavern
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Too much drink, I expect. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Keep your voice down. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | If #topic.subject# comes in, I'm sitting by the door. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_violence_street
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence here.place=street|gate|market
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Walk where it's busy. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Look about you, after this. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Out here, where anyone could pass.

rule s83g_violence_guard
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say We're looking into it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | Off duty, mind: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | If it's true #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, the Watch will want #topic.them#.

rule s83g_violence_healer
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence self.job=healer|priest
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll pray for the hurt one. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#, they say. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. If anyone's hurt, I'm here. | Bruises heal. The fear takes longer. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_violence_merchant
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence self.role=merchant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll keep a cudgel under the counter. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Bad for trade, a fighter about. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'll not serve #topic.them#.

rule s83g_violence_old
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence self.stage=old
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Violence. In this town. | Never thought I'd live to hear it. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | When I was young we'd settle it with words. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_violence_poor
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=violence self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Down our end, they're saying #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. And it's us that live with it. | Doors don't lock on our row. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

## ================================================================ Robbed or set upon by someone nobody saw

rule s83g_victim_1
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #s8_psst# #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Poor #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. #pity#.

rule s83g_victim_2
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Have you heard about #topic.subject#? #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Can you imagine? | It could have been any of us. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_victim_3
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. Nobody saw a thing. | #hearsay#. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. That's what frightens me. No face to it.

rule s83g_victim_4
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Someone should look in on #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I keep thinking of #topic.them#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I hope #topic.they#'s all right.

rule s83g_victim_night
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim here.time=night|dusk
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Don't walk home alone. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | After dark, too, I'd wager. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Keep to the lamps tonight. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.

rule s83g_victim_guard
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say No description, nothing. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | We've nothing to go on. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. If you hear anything, I want to know.

rule s83g_victim_warmth
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim self.warmth=warm
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say I'll take a pie round to #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. | Oh, #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.claim#. I could weep. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. We should all go round.

rule s83g_victim_merchant
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=victim self.role=merchant
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Every stall's worried. #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I'll close before dark this week. | #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. It's bad for all of us.

## ================================================================ A wedding

rule s83g_marriage_1
when concept=talk.gossip topic.claim_kind=marriage
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
